From 50cc940c9bd8f5553687c2f94eae396c660d6e2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rebase <rebase@local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:55:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] router: restore native OS routing support

The MetaCubeX update removes osrouter and linuxfw, but the native
backend needs their kernel route and firewall implementation. Restore
the packages from 1ab893d4162c as an independent patch.
